thub.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/tarball/v3.1.8","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/zipball/v3.1.8","body":"∩╗┐## Pulse Music v3.1.8 (OTA Update for Android & Windows)\n\n### ≡ƒÄê Mini Capsule & Dynamic Island Enhancements\n- ≡ƒÄ╡ **Mini Live Equalizer Waveform**: Slender animated tri-bar spectrum that rhythmically reacts to music playback directly inside the mini capsule.\n- ≡ƒÄñ **Synchronized Karaoke Lyrics Ticker**: Real-time line-by-line lyric tracker right on the capsule. Tap the artist name to switch seamlessly between artist info and live lyrics!\n- ≡ƒÅ╖∩╕Å **Audio Quality Badge**: Crystal-clear codec indicators (Lossless, OPUS, AAC, HQ) rendered directly beside the track metadata.\n- ≡ƒÅ¥∩╕Å **Expandable Floating Dynamic Island Overlay**: Long-press on the Mini Capsule to expand into an immersive liquid-glass dynamic player with album art, smooth seek scrubber with timestamps, full transport controls (Shuffle, Previous, Play/Pause, Next, Like), and quick volume adjustment!\n\n### ≡ƒÜÇ Update Engine & CDN Prioritization\n- CDN Prioritization (cdn.jsdelivr.net & raw GitHub) completely eliminates GitHub API 60-req/hr rate limiting (403 errors on shared mobile carrier CGNAT IPs).\n- 64-bit ID & Asset Deserialization: Full support for GitHub 64-bit integer IDs and multi-gigabyte asset sizes, permanently eliminating 'Server Error 200' crashes.\n- Resilient Content-Type handling for raw text/plain payloads, eliminating NoTransformationFoundException.\n- Friendly error notifications: Clear, graceful UI alerts replacing cryptic raw HTTP status codes.\n\n### ≡ƒÄ╡ Enhanced Lyrics Accuracy & Quality\n- Strict title & artist normalization prevents irrelevant song lyrics from being matched.\n- Empty lyrics filtering: Completely eliminates blank or placeholder lyrics cards from playback screens.\n\n### ≡ƒîÉ Listen Together Latency & Reconnection\n- Fixed coroutine cleanup race condition preventing secondary room connections.\n- Purged stale room tokens on leave/disconnect to ensure immediate room rejoin.\n- Reduced handshake and socket timeouts for faster session initialization.\n\n### ΓÜí General Performance & Stability\n- Polished stability across Android & Windows platforms.\r\n"}
